{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_lasher_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_lasher_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "遺失之物",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lasher_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8d2605678deea9904d07cfc5349d991e2333f1ddc6cf9e0b252fd784172adbdf",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "米奧，米奧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "（不耐煩地甩尾巴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "怎麼回事啊，米奧……？從昨天開始就一直昏昏欲睡的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "奇怪，該不會真的生病了吧……讓我看一下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "*古薩爾貢俚語*！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "不要抓我的眼皮，沒規矩的僕人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "你再這樣，我就……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "Zzz……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "米奧？又昏過去了……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "不用擔心，拉恕爾，我們沒你想像的那麼脆弱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……好吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "拍賣會就快要開始了，還有很多事需要準備，我要趕快出門了……沃奧，可以請你幫我照顧米奧嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "嗯，沒問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "我和米奧都知道，除了找守護者的寶石，你還有很多別的責任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "比起我們，把你有限的精力，放在更重要的事情上吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "丟了？你們說……“落星”丟了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "對、對不起！我們找了一晚上，倉庫的每個角落都翻遍了，可是還是沒找到……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "那可是本次拍賣會的壓軸拍賣品……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "拉恕爾大人……拍賣會就快要開始了，我們現在該怎麼辦……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "多雅德，你先去聯絡最近幾天來過倉庫的所有訪客，尤其是曾經問過或接觸過“落星”的人，一個都不能漏掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "……好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "阿巴斯，你去做一套拍賣會延期的備案，評估場地改期的費用和委託違約賠償金的總額。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "我知道了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "我會去聯絡新的拍賣品委託方，看看能不能找到比“落星”更好的拍賣品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "大家不必太過慌張，總會有辦法的。我們先同心協力把拍賣會的事處理好吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所員工們",
      "text": "……是，拉恕爾大人！我們會照您說的去辦！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "……還以為會被直接開除。原來交易所的員工常常被換掉，不是因為他們做錯事嗎……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "話說，這真的是太突然了。每次到了關鍵時刻，都一定會出問題……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "要是能找到就好了……我多希望這只是一場惡夢……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "是的，如果您有願意委託給拍賣會拍賣的寶石，就太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "為難的商店老闆",
      "text": "很抱歉……前幾天有收購商把店裡比較高級的寶石全都買走了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……您不必道歉，本來就是我冒然來訪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲憊的商店老闆",
      "text": "拉恕爾大人，我已經把我的貨品都給您看過了，我這裡沒有能符合您要求的寶石。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "沒關係，我再去其他店看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的商店老闆",
      "text": "哎呀，拉恕爾大人，您看看這枚水晶胸針怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "它的瑕疵很明顯，恐怕沒辦法當我們壓軸的拍賣品項。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的商店老闆",
      "text": "這有什麼不能的？您只要幫它開個亮眼的價格，就是比其他拍賣品的估價高那麼一點點……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "殷勤的商店老闆",
      "text": "既然是監管人開的價，就不能算是什麼耍花招……只要您願意，好處什麼的，都好說！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "不，我拒絕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "失陪了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "……拉恕爾大人，是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "什麼事，阿巴斯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "……我有個壞消息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "剛剛王酋使者來通知我們，有位名叫索斯比的外國富商過幾天會來米城。他和王酋有很多重要的合作，請我們一定要好好招待他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "索斯比先生就是為了拍賣會上有保健功效的寶石來的，考慮到他的行程安排，我們就算要延期舉辦，也沒辦法延後太久……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "而且使者說，索斯比先生之前看過拍賣會的宣傳單，很好奇“落星”到底是怎麼發揮保健功效的，所以他想在預覽會上提前看一下“落星”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "索斯比先生會在這裡待多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "他之後還要去汐斯塔參加音樂節……所以最多待一個禮拜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "把拍賣會延期到他離開前那一天吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "和“落星”接觸過的人，多雅德調查得怎麼樣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "都確認過了，全都可以排除嫌疑……真的是遇到怪事了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "唉……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "謹慎的聲音",
      "text": "……拉恕爾大人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "沒關係，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "如果沒有別的事，我就先掛了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "還有什麼事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客氣的聲音",
      "text": "您好，請問您有沒有遇到什麼困難？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……你是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客氣的聲音",
      "text": "打擾了，這裡是四尾鱗家事管理公司。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客氣的聲音",
      "text": "電器維修、管道清潔、除蟲消毒、失物尋找，我們致力於為您的生活排憂解難！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客氣的聲音",
      "text": "如果有需要，歡迎您隨時撥打這支電話……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "我不需要。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客氣的聲音",
      "text": "嗯？可是您的聲音聽起來很累，確定不需要嗎？您要不要再考慮一下……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "不……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客氣的聲音",
      "text": "沒關係，請您儘管說，任何困難我們都會盡力幫您解決的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "客氣的聲音",
      "text": "或者，您可以先留一下這支電話號碼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "夠了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "等一下，剛剛那個人是不是說……“失物尋找”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "天啊……我在想什麼？我居然想讓一個來路不明的家事管理公司幫忙找一個貴重的拍賣品。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "不要再想著要找“落星”了……我必須想想其他辦法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一條黑暗狹窄的小巷。從商鋪鱗次櫛比的大巴扎要返回交易所，這是最近的一條路。\n年輕的監管人孤身一人，他聽見從磚瓦縫隙間傳來的議論聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牆後的議論聲",
      "text": "哎哎，看來交易所又出事了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牆後的議論聲",
      "text": "什麼，這有什麼好擔心的，又不是第一次了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牆後的議論聲",
      "text": "拉恕爾大人對每次的拍賣會都非常重視……但就算有一次辦不好，又會怎樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牆後的議論聲",
      "text": "哼，怎麼會辦不好？只要那些有著神奇功效的寶石繼續聚集到米納特哈瑪儀，就不會辦不好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牆後的議論聲",
      "text": "你等著瞧吧，有拉恕爾大人，這次的拍賣會一定會是最成功的一次！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "監管人想起自己小時候常常躲在這條黑暗的小巷，讓母親和外祖父到處找他。\n那時他天真地覺得，只要這樣，就能讓他們打開那扇厚重的磚色大門，從漫長的職責與罪孽中走出來。\n可是他現在卻對曾在這裡走過的每一位祖先的沉重心情，深深地感同身受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "忽然，一個熟悉的身影停在他的身前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……沃奧？你怎麼過來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "已經很晚了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "真的，都這麼晚了……我本來是應該多陪陪你們的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "米奧怎麼樣……恢復精神了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "比起米奧，你應該擔心你自己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "走吧，拉恕爾，回去好好睡一覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二天"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……我有點頭痛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "叫你好好休息，你就一定要熬夜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "沒辦法，我需要把參加的買家資料都看一遍。已經沒什麼時間了，我要快點了解他們的需求和喜好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "對了，沃奧，你覺得我要不要找個獸醫來看看米奧？我還是有點擔心……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "我說過，如果我們不想讓人類接近，對方根本就看不見我們，放棄這個想法吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "可是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "唉，你真是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "不要舔手腕這裡啊，好癢……沃奧，好啦，我知道，你想叫我摸摸你的頭，對嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "（仰起頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "唉，對不起，這兩天有點忽略你們了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "我沒事，米奧也不會有事。我們更希望你不要忽略自己的感受。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "可是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "你看，笑得這麼勉強，就像照片上的這個人一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "照片……？你是說索斯比先生的這張吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "是啊。明明跟他合照的其他人都笑得那麼燦爛，他卻只是擠一擠嘴角，連牙齒都沒露出來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "還真的是這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "等一下，他檔案裡的其他照片也都是這樣……就連和他最愛的樂團合照的時候也是……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "這有什麼意思嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "你可能幫了我一個大忙，沃奧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "法爾希德先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "剛起床，秘書就幫我安排了這個緊急會面的行程，我還覺得奇怪，原來是拉恕爾大人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "有什麼事需要您親自大駕光臨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "我今日前來，是想跟你做個交易。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "我知道，你的收藏中有一顆銘刻工藝極為高超的黃綠寶石，不管是它的功效還是它的外觀，都無可挑剔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "……您是指“沙海之日”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "看來，拉恕爾大人是想把我的“沙海之日”打造成壓軸拍賣品？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "既然你已經知道我的想法，那接下來就簡單了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "相信法爾希德先生也一定知道，監管人非常少主動走出大巴扎，與不做寶石生意的市民談生意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "是嗎？我以為您的母親和外祖父從不找我談生意，是因為他們不喜歡我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "誰叫我做寶石商人的時候不守規矩呢。他們是怎麼說的？我擅用他們的名號來抬高寶石的價格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "你確實是有這麼做，而且那樣違背了我們建立寶石交易所的初衷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "反正我的寶石買賣經營許可證已經被吊銷了。還好天無絕人之路……我的廣告公司倒是發展得還算不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "只可惜我的那些寶石珍藏，只能堆在家裡，獨留我一人欣賞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "看來，法爾希德先生是打算拒絕我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "我了解了，抱歉打擾了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "哎，您等一下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "作為米城市民，我當然願意幫助新上任的監管人完成工作。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "只是交易所的委託費用畢竟不是一筆小數目……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "交易所會幫你免除。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "那……我的經營許可？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "你可以先向交易所提交恢復申請，在經過一段時間的觀察之後，我會讓你通過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "還有觀察期啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……請不要得寸進尺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "哈……好，這樣夠了，很有誠意。那就這樣決定了，晚一點，我會把“沙海之日”送去交易所。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "在這裡做生意的人都知道，拉恕爾大人您一諾千金。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "拉恕爾大人，法爾希德那傢伙該不會不同意吧，我之前聽說他跟交易所關係不太好的樣子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "他同意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "呼……那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "看您臉色鐵青，我還以為您吃了閉門羹……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "對了，這是您叫我調查的索斯比先生近期的消費記錄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "果然如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "您在看的是……他的醫療美容消費記錄？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "內容是……牙齒美白？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "嗯，看來我們沒有找錯方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "拉恕爾大人！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "很抱歉，我還有一個很小很小的請求！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……你說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "最近嘛，我的公司經營得也不太順利，沒做出什麼火紅廣告，但是這次，我有個完美的點子……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "不管是要宣傳“沙海之日”，還是要顛覆市民們心中對交易所過於莊重、嚴肅的印象，它都會起到很大作用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "人們對交易所的印象，不需要被顛覆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "……哎呀，當然更多是為了讓我的公司增加點話題度和曝光度嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "“沙海之日”的事是您有求於我……這次就當是我有求於您，我們互有所求，不就是做生意？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "您一定不會拒絕我的，對不對？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "（小聲）拉恕爾大人，這傢伙現在完全就是趁人之危，得寸進尺……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "所以，你到底要我做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "其實，既然要成為拍賣品，我想要為“沙海之日”做一套宣傳海報……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "寶石收藏家",
      "text": "……我覺得拉恕爾大人您，就是海報模特的不二人選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "我們來試一下，等我說完台詞，您就抬起下巴，露出牙齒，笑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "哎，對！請您再往右站一點，臉要貼著雕像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "笑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "我是說……請您露齒微笑，這樣才能展現“沙海之日”的非凡功效啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "青春一點！陽光一點！咧開嘴笑吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "欸，不對，不要皺眉頭啊……等一下，是有剛好拍到一張，還不錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "多雅德，這到底怎麼回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "法爾希德那傢伙到底用了什麼魔法，居然能讓拉恕爾大人答應親自來當潔牙廣告的模特兒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "說來話長……反正你小心點，我覺得拉恕爾大人現在肯定滿肚子火，你不要火上加油。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "嚯……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "好了，這裡就先這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "海報攝影師",
      "text": "您可能太緊張了，我們換個您更熟悉的場景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "這些海報拍的不錯，它們會貼在交易所和大巴扎的牆上多久？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……最多到拍賣會結束。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "留著吧，我還蠻喜歡背景是交易所的這張，笑得很自然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "不要提這件事了，沃奧……我的臉到現在還是僵的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "米奧還在睡……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "只是多睡幾天而已。以前，我和米奧還一口氣睡過好幾百年的覺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "……拉恕爾，等拍賣會結束了，你也該好好休息一陣子了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "你也知道，就連平常的時候，交易所和大巴扎的雜事也很多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "你累了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "當然不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "只是最近有時候會做一些奇怪的夢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "夢裡的我好像不是交易所幕後的監管人，而是一隻被放生的發條羽獸，漫無目的地飛過街道，風大的時候就停下來休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "（悠哉地翻身）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "（自在地搖尾巴）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "像米奧這樣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "哈哈哈，可能吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "不過……米奧要是再不醒來，可就要錯過這次的拍賣會了，本來想請你們也一起留意城外商人們帶來的消息的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "守護者的寶石，還有兩顆下落不明啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "拉恕爾，在尋找守護者寶石的同時，我希望你銘記，你的時光也很有限。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "我的時間有限，但監管人的一生到寶石歸還的那天才會結束。我只是在做我該做的事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……而且，我也希望你們與那位寶庫守護者早一些重逢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "畢竟，對於你和米奧來說，他很重要吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "……當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "拉恕爾，你上一次拍私人照片，是什麼時候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "上一次……好像是母親還活著的時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "之後再請拍海報的攝影師幫我們一起拍一個合照吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "雖然我也不知道他的相機能不能把我和米奧拍進去，但是至少你會知道我們在你的身邊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "沃奧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……好啊，那就這樣吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "拍賣會當天"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "索斯比先生，請問需要茶或咖啡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國富商",
      "text": "不用，就給我一杯沒有任何色素的檸檬水就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "好，您慢用。如果您有任何需要，隨時可以叫我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國富商",
      "text": "謝謝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "怎麼樣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "拉恕爾大人說得沒錯，索斯比先生確實是有一口大黃牙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "那他有沒有問“落星”的事……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "一句也沒有。他一直緊緊抓著“沙海之日”的廣告，就是有拉恕爾大人照片的那張。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "看來這次他覺得他贏定了啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "接下來，我們將競標本屆拍賣會的壓軸品項。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "它比薩爾貢的炎陽更加耀眼，感謝我們的委託方，法爾希德先生為我們帶來這顆珍貴的寶石——“沙海之日”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "起拍價——九百萬第納爾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "一千一百萬，一千三百萬，一千五百萬，一千七百萬……還有人要繼續出價嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國富商",
      "text": "（舉牌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "好的，索斯比先生，一千九百萬，感謝您的支持。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米城富商",
      "text": "（舉牌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "來自提坦金飾的夏爾瑪女士，兩千一百萬，也感謝您的支持。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國富商",
      "text": "（舉牌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米城富商",
      "text": "（舉牌）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "兩千三百萬，兩千五百萬，兩千七百萬……目前的最高出價是兩千九百萬，是來自魔瓶商會的哈沐德先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "欸，索斯比先生，您這是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國富商",
      "text": "我就把我的牌子放在這了，剛才那個員工呢？快點，看是用源石技藝還是什麼其他辦法，幫我把我的牌子釘在牆上！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國富商",
      "text": "不管你們怎麼出價，我這個牌子會都一直舉著！不會放下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "外國富商",
      "text": "我看還有誰要跟我搶“沙海之日”！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……那麼，索斯比先生開價三千一百萬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "成交！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "哇，感覺好奇怪……拍賣會圓滿結束，事情就這麼解決了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所男員工",
      "text": "沒想到索斯比先生會那麼滿意……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "交易所女員工",
      "text": "哎，早就跟你說過了，拉恕爾大人一定能帶著我們化險為夷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "我也沒辦法保證每次都能完美收場。而且，“落星”也還沒找到啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "你好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……什麼？你說……米奧……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……沒有呼吸了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "米奧、米奧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "糟糕……他的呼吸真的變的好弱……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "你再撐一下，我現在就帶你去看醫生……！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奧",
      "text": "我跟你說過了，醫生也沒辦法的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "沃奧，幫我一下，我要把米奧抱起來……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "欸？什麼東西從墊子裡掉出來了……？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "（伸懶腰）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "（張大嘴打哈欠）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "一顆寶石……這……這是失蹤的“落星”，它怎麼會在米奧的睡墊子下面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "吵死了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "你剛才說什麼，拉恕爾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……米奧，你終於醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "終於？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "所以，原來是“落星”讓你昏睡的啊……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "“一顆有著安神助眠功效的寶石。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "明明之前的拍賣品介紹上有寫，我早就應該想到的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "作為監管人，你難道不應該好好看著這種這麼危險的寶石嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "……就連身為主人的我都能被打敗，它的力量真是厲害。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……你要拿去玩，要跟我說一下啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "找不到這顆寶石，害我忙壞了……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "（盯）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "啊？你是在責怪我嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "我也想啊，誰知道我只是抱著它躺了一下，就完全沒有意識了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "我都睡著了，要怎麼跟你說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "這……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "而且……這不是都是你的錯嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……啊？我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "要是你早點把我抱起來，讓我離開這顆寶石的影響範圍，我就不會睡這麼久，你也能找到寶石了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "那……你還有沒有哪裡不舒服？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "哼……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "除了突然被你吵醒以外，也沒有什麼不舒服的……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "……哎，你這個小人類，你在傻笑什麼啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕爾",
      "text": "哈……沒什麼，沒什麼，你沒事就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米奧",
      "text": "欸，你抱太緊了……拉恕爾！我還沒原諒你耶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
